      "{**42 NY3d at 366} OPINION OF THE COURT",
      "Defendant pleaded guilty to criminal possession of a controlled substance in the seventh degree. The Appellate Term affirmed, with one Justice dissenting (78 Misc 3d 1 [App Term, 2d Dept, 2d, 11th & 13th Jud Dists 2022]). The court held that Detective Fortunato's testimony sufficiently established \"that the detective had probable cause to lawfully stop the vehicle due to an apparent violation of Vehicle and Traffic Law § 375 (12-a) (b) (2)\" (id. at 6 [internal quotation marks omitted]). A Judge of this Court granted defendant leave to appeal (39 NY3d 1156 [2023])."
